    {
      "_id": "2hUfjBb0b6TQerOR",
      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The warlock is a 14th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Intelligence (spell save DC 15, +7 to hit with spell attacks). It regains its expended spell slots when it finishes a short or long rest. It knows the following warlock spells: Cantrips (at will): <em>blade ward</em>, <em>chill touch</em>, ✦ <em>fel flame</em>, <em>mage hand</em>, ✦ <em>shadow bolt</em> 1st - 5th level (4 5th level slots): <em>arms of hadar</em>, <em>bestow curse</em>, ✦ <em>demon skin</em>, <em>far step</em> ^XGE^, ✦ <em>fire and brimstone</em>, <em>fear</em>, <em>immolation</em> ^XGE^, <em>negative energy flood</em> ^XGE^, <em>ray of sickness</em>, <em>sickening radiance</em> ^XGE^ The warlock cast <em>demon skin</em> on itself before combat. This adds 5 hit points to its max hp (included above).</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
